RT 1-", "bbox": {"x": 100.7334533890045, "y": 480.9460892492582, "width": 110.12338910784042, "height": 28.107820252577433}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "GENERAL INFORMATION", "bbox": {"x": 229.11051190299713, "y": 481.2499999836309, "width": 389.48787061994614, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Section 10-", "bbox": {"x": 160.37735826145553, "y": 549.9999999618055, "width": 146.63072776280325, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Overview of the budget process", "bbox": {"x": 307.0080859583028, "y": 549.9999999756945, "width": 435.3099730458221, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What is the budget?..", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946067004017, "y": 582.0833333030661, "width": 261.1859838274932, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What is the legal requirement to prepare the budget?...", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946068078553, "y": 614.1666666552082, "width": 659.8382749326146, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What kinds of information does the budget provide?...", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946067914907, "y": 650.833333321875, "width": 664.4204851752021, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Which agencies does the budget cover?.", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946068733154, "y": 682.9166666536948, "width": 485.7142857142859, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What is the coverage of the Federal budget process and when?..", "bbox": {"x": 206.1994606832157, "y": 714.999999990394, "width": 778.9757412398923, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What is the Mid-Session Review?...", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946067969454, "y": 747.0833333155093, "width": 435.3099730458221, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What are the central financial agencies?........", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946065949568, "y": 783.7499999871495, "width": 549.8652291105121, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What are the responsibilities and functions of OMB?....", "bbox": {"x": 206.1994606776508, "y": 815.8333333236503, "width": 678.167115902965, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What are the responsibilities and functions of the Treasury?..", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946068300868, "y": 847.9166666565774, "width": 742.3180592991913, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What are the responsibilities and functions of CBO?.......", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946067096657, "y": 879.9999999885416, "width": 687.3315363881402, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What are the responsibilities and functions of GAO?.", "bbox": {"x": 206.051659022335, "y": 911.4186493307918, "width": 650.9789808741156, "height": 34.59541896979006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "How do OMB, CBO, the Fiscal Service, and GAO responsibilities overlap?..", "bbox": {"x": 201.61725044247558, "y": 948.7499999920585, "width": 943.9353099730457, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Section 15-Basic budget laws", "bbox": {"x": 160.37735823501976, "y": 1017.4999999794338, "width": 407.81671159029645, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What laws govern the budget cycle?...", "bbox": {"x": 201.61725043773038, "y": 1049.5833333169642, "width": 471.96765498652286, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Why is the Budget and Accounting Act important?..", "bbox": {"x": 206.1994605970759, "y": 1081.6666666504632, "width": 632.345013477089, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "How does the Congress enact the budget and how is the budget enforced?....", "bbox": {"x": 201.61725040328577, "y": 1113.749999984722, "width": 934.7708894878707, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "What laws gover the budget execution process when funds are actually", "bbox": {"x": 206.00635431374204, "y": 1145.7347697578746, "width": 884.6824707689311, "height": 40.78142801920575}}, {"kind": "text", "text": 